# N4 (sem:400; next_core_tasks_v3.md N4): the data operand of `call: code data`, EXEC's slot 1, evaluated once after
# the code selected `callee`. A RECEIVING admission there reads its requirement in the callee's space
# (lmx_walk_admit_in), as a receiving input of the same EXEC does; any other operand is the caller's expression. The
# value must be a present reference to a Structure: a held null is the implicit `interpreter` throw, anything else
# INVALID.  A CALL_DATA hands its data operand on the same terms and its place table out (tokens, table), for the
# call's admission; any other slot 1 has none.
# Body moved to the ordinary machine module lmx_walk_values.lm2.

