# Body moved to the ordinary machine module lmx_walk_values.lm2.
# Body moved to the ordinary machine module lmx_walk_values.lm2.

# An explicit source throw uses the same status and payload as a native method.
# Its key cell is the thrown name's identity, written when the source graph is
# built (lmx_walk.h, LMX_WALK_NAME_*); the interpreter never resolves the saved
# spelling. Evaluate every actual before constructing the payload, so a throw
# from an actual remains that throw.
