# THE ENTRY RECEPTION (lmx_walk.h, LMX_WALK_SOURCE_RECEPTION): every step of the selected body whose source role is
# RECEPTION is a formal's receiving act. It runs here, once and in body order, after the inputs are open and before the
# entry load and the body, outside every pad of the body: a refusal is THROWN + IMPLEMENTS out of this activation, the
# call's `implements`, and no step of the body has run.
