# ENTRY (k.4, next_core_tasks.md §3 item 9: no descriptor, no cached plan -- nothing
# beyond the two graph values themselves). `code` and `data` each have the
# common Lmx header, including Array; that is the structural eligibility check. The activation
# also prepares its input values, which can fail on an invalid argument graph.
# There is no "callable" test and no refusal for a
# code Structure with zero body steps -- "no operator" is not "invalid", it is a body
# that runs zero steps and falls off the end, the same as any other (author, §3 item 8:
