# N4 (2026-10-17): the unary data of a call. A four-part fn occurrence runs
# over its own var part; every other callee runs over itself. The selection
# is structural, at each site that knows the call form; an explicitly passed
# data Structure -- an alias `call: F F` included -- reaches its activation
# unchanged, equal pointer or not. The fn receiver's result is allocated in
